  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44129796",
      "title": "Exercise: Solution",
      "lectureOrder": 259,
      "videoOrder": 247,
      "sourceHash": "dc4c1e26706d5da9e2e0f4468672ccf6e3a931b43292c322a3dbbe664e5d5855",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 2.88,
          "en": "So, did you succeed?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.88,
          "end": 6.42,
          "en": "Let's now register this email and password field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.42,
          "end": 9.33,
          "en": "and let's set up this overall form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.33,
          "end": 11.55,
          "en": "And for that, in the signup component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.55,
          "end": 15.077,
          "en": "I'll start by adding a property name form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.077,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "Though as mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 19.333,
          "en": "this is not a technical requirement.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.333,
          "end": 21.09,
          "en": "But what is a requirement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.09,
          "end": 23.4,
          "en": "is that it should be of type form group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.4,
          "end": 25.89,
          "en": "It should be a new form group instance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.89,
          "end": 28.893,
          "en": "and form group is imported from Angular forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 29.76,
          "end": 31.8,
          "en": "Then, we pass an object to that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 35.34,
          "en": "and then we register our form controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.34,
          "end": 38.46,
          "en": "as key value pairs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.46,
          "end": 40.206,
          "en": "So, for example, the email control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.206,
          "end": 44.07,
          "en": "is registered by creating a new form control like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.07,
          "end": 49.07,
          "en": "And form control also must be imported from Angular forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.37,
          "end": 53.07,
          "en": "Now, here, the initial value can be an empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 53.07,
          "end": 55.901,
          "en": "and we can also add some validators,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 55.901,
          "end": 59.07,
          "en": "though that was not part of the task.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.07,
          "end": 63.42,
          "en": "But if you did it, great. If you didn't, you can do it now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.42,
          "end": 65.16,
          "en": "And here, I'm adding the email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.16,
          "end": 69.33,
          "en": "and the required validators from that validators class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.33,
          "end": 72.18299999999999,
          "en": "that's also provided by Angular forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.23,
          "end": 75.75,
          "en": "Now, that's one of the two inputs you should add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.75,
          "end": 77.94,
          "en": "The second one is the password input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.94,
          "end": 81.276,
          "en": "The password control, that's also a FormControl",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.276,
          "end": 85.14,
          "en": "with an empty string as a default value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.14,
          "end": 90,
          "en": "And then, here, validators could be Validators.required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90,
          "end": 95,
          "en": "and Validators.minLength(6) just as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.45,
          "end": 98.7,
          "en": "So, that sets up the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.7,
          "end": 100.83,
          "en": "To connect it to the template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.83,
          "end": 104.55,
          "en": "we now must add some directives here, as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.55,
          "end": 106.97999999999999,
          "en": "And for those directives to be available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.97999999999999,
          "end": 111.243,
          "en": "you first of all need to import the ReactiveFormsModule.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 115.86,
          "en": "With that imported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.86,
          "end": 118.643,
          "en": "you can go back and connect the overall form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.643,
          "end": 121.768,
          "en": "by adding the formGroup directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.768,
          "end": 124.89,
          "en": "And then, by using property binding to bind it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.89,
          "end": 128.553,
          "en": "to the form property, we add it to the TypeScript class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.23,
          "end": 134.97,
          "en": "To then connect this input email, we can use form control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.97,
          "end": 139.263,
          "en": "and bind that to form.controls.email,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.22,
          "end": 142.25,
          "en": "or we use that shortcut",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.25,
          "end": 145,
          "en": "and instead we just use formControlName",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.49,
          "end": 148.89,
          "en": "and set that to the name we chose,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.89,
          "end": 151.29,
          "en": "which in my case is email.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.29,
          "end": 155.57999999999998,
          "en": "And we can do the same here for the password input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.57999999999998,
          "end": 156.413,
          "en": "And at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 156.413,
          "end": 158.79,
          "en": "these are the only two inputs I wanna connect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.79,
          "end": 161.733,
          "en": "because I haven't set up any other inputs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.99,
          "end": 165.03,
          "en": "Now, to handle form submission,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.03,
          "end": 169.773,
          "en": "we can again use ngSubmit and trigger onSubmit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 171.03,
          "end": 171.99,
          "en": "And then, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.99,
          "end": 176.64,
          "en": "we have to add this onSubmit method here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 176.64,
          "end": 177.81,
          "en": "And then, here for the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 177.81,
          "end": 179.56,
          "en": "I'll simply console.log(this.form).",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.93,
          "end": 184.11,
          "en": "We could also extract the entered values and log those,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.11,
          "end": 186.633,
          "en": "but here I'll just log the overall form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 188.28,
          "end": 190.68,
          "en": "To also handle form resetting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.68,
          "end": 195.166,
          "en": "I'll go down to that reset button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.166,
          "end": 197.22,
          "en": "which is of type=\"reset\".",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.22,
          "end": 200.7,
          "en": "And actually at the moment, if I would save it like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.7,
          "end": 203.198,
          "en": "and I entered something here into email",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 203.198,
          "end": 206.763,
          "en": "and I clicked reset, it would already reset it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 207.75,
          "end": 209.55,
          "en": "What you can still do in addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.55,
          "end": 211.361,
          "en": "is you can add a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.361,
          "end": 214.74,
          "en": "and trigger a onReset method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 214.74,
          "end": 217.26,
          "en": "or whatever name you wanna use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 217.26,
          "end": 219.55,
          "en": "And then, you could add such a method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 221.31,
          "end": 223.2,
          "en": "and then use this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 223.2,
          "end": 226.47,
          "en": "and call the reset method on that form object to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.47,
          "end": 231.36,
          "en": "that the internally managed status is reset and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 231.36,
          "end": 233.7,
          "en": "Though that should actually also happen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 233.7,
          "end": 236.643,
          "en": "if you rely on the standard reset mechanism.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.6,
          "end": 240.3,
          "en": "But now, we could set this to type=\"button\" too",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 240.3,
          "end": 243.3,
          "en": "and it would still reset the form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 243.3,
          "end": 244.133,
          "en": "As you can tell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.133,
          "end": 246.813,
          "en": "if I enter an email address and I click reset.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 248.52,
          "end": 251.61,
          "en": "So, that's really up to you how you wanna solve it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 251.61,
          "end": 254.49,
          "en": "It's just important to know that this form object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 254.49,
          "end": 257.433,
          "en": "of course, still has this reset method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.02,
          "end": 262.322,
          "en": "Well, and that's essentially the task solved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 262.322,
          "end": 265.26,
          "en": "I added an email and a password control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.26,
          "end": 269.76,
          "en": "and I connected them to my inputs here in the template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 269.76,
          "end": 272.58,
          "en": "And therefore, we're now ready to dive deeper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 272.58,
          "end": 275.853,
          "en": "and use more reactive forms features.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
